WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.122 --> 00:00:02.002
- [Voiceover] I cry
every time my mother says

00:00:02.002 --> 00:00:03.642
she's proud of my weight loss.

00:00:03.642 --> 00:00:05.882
She still doesn't know I'm anorexic.

00:00:05.882 --> 00:00:09.132
(exotic chiming music)

00:00:20.956 --> 00:00:22.642
- [Voiceover] Whenever my
boyfriend sees my body,

00:00:22.642 --> 00:00:24.957
I'm scared that he'll notice I'm anorexic.

00:00:24.957 --> 00:00:26.642
- [Voiceover] I tell people
I'm on a liquid diet.

00:00:26.642 --> 00:00:28.562
What they don't realize
is that I'm anorexic,

00:00:28.562 --> 00:00:31.277
and the only liquid in my diet is water.

00:00:31.277 --> 00:00:32.521
- [Voiceover] I have anorexia.

00:00:32.521 --> 00:00:35.441
My head keeps telling me,
pretty girls don't eat.

00:00:35.441 --> 00:00:36.441
- [Voiceover] I'm anorexic.

00:00:36.441 --> 00:00:38.082
I hate myself with a passion.

00:00:38.082 --> 00:00:40.601
The only time I eat is
when I'm going drinking,

00:00:40.601 --> 00:00:42.121
because being drunk is the only thing

00:00:42.121 --> 00:00:43.802
that takes away the pain.

00:00:43.802 --> 00:00:45.681
- [Voiceover] I only eat
in front of my parents

00:00:45.681 --> 00:00:47.241
so they won't find out I'm anorexic

00:00:47.241 --> 00:00:49.201
and send me to recovery.

00:00:49.201 --> 00:00:50.481
- [Voiceover] I tell
everyone I'm losing weight

00:00:50.481 --> 00:00:51.761
because I exercise,

00:00:51.761 --> 00:00:54.442
but the truth is I'm anorexic.

00:00:54.442 --> 00:00:56.401
- [Voiceover] I'm anorexic
and I'm trying to get better.

00:00:56.401 --> 00:00:59.361
I can't stand that every
restaurant displays calories.

00:00:59.361 --> 00:01:00.961
It's so triggering.

00:01:00.961 --> 00:01:03.242
- [Voiceover] I denied the
fact that I have anorexia.

00:01:03.242 --> 00:01:04.841
Today I saw my sister start to

00:01:04.841 --> 00:01:07.356
hate on her body the way I do.

00:01:07.356 --> 00:01:10.157
She's eight, this really hit home.

00:01:10.157 --> 00:01:12.241
I need to change for her sake.

00:01:12.241 --> 00:01:14.562
- [Voiceover] I recovered
from anorexia four years ago.

00:01:14.562 --> 00:01:17.202
I used to pray to God
that he would let me die.

00:01:17.202 --> 00:01:20.002
But surviving has made
me a stronger person.

00:01:20.002 --> 00:01:22.281
I'm proud of who I've become.

00:01:22.281 --> 00:01:24.948
(ambient music)

00:01:32.272 --> 00:01:34.404
(creaky swiveling)

